      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for this. It's a good start and definitely hits the main points, but it's a bit too brief for what the managers are looking for. They really want a \"comprehensive\" deep dive into the feedback so they don't have to read every single individual review.\n\nCan you expand this significantly? I need a much more \"detailed\" and \"thorough\" breakdown of all the specific points mentioned—the build, the software, the hardware, etc. \n\nI'll reiterate: please don't just repeat the same sentences over and over or add empty filler just to make it longer. I need you to actually unpack the nuances of what people are saying to make it a truly detailed report. Aim for much more depth and length, but keep it substantive.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
