      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's better, but it's still feeling pretty condensed. It feels more like a \"summary of a summary\" rather than a truly comprehensive report. I think you might be playing it a bit too safe because of my warning about fluff.\n\nThe managers really want to see every single detail we can pull from these reviews so we don't miss anything. If people mentioned the charger feels cheap, or that the 5G drains the battery, or that the notch is distracting—I want to see those specifics reflected in a much larger, more exhaustive analysis. \n\nLet's try one more time. Please provide a much longer, extremely detailed, and deep breakdown of every single sentiment expressed in those 50 reviews. Try to get the length up significantly by really elaborating on every single pro and con. Just please, make sure it's actually \"detailed\" and not just \"wordy\" for the sake of it. I really need this to be a massive, thorough document.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
